d=Text("Reference rates are benchmark or indicative market rates used for pricing and valuation, while travelers usually receive a worse rate because providers add a spread, fees, and sometimes cash handling or card conversion charges. ECB and NSE publish reference-style rates, and Reuters notes its market quote data can be delayed, which also distinguishes it from the final retail rate a traveler pays. [12][3]")
